title: Settings › Agent map › Which agents work in which flow
route: /settings
intro: The sixteen agents on Settings are named all over the app. This follows the journey of a case through the sidebar and lists the agents that act on each screen, as the demo shows them.
dir: TD
also: Built by searching the code for where each agent appears. Sentinel has no screen of its own, only a notification. The next diagram lists the same thing agent by agent.
---
screen emr "EMR Connect\nReader: pulls files, matches charts, maps fields\nVerify: re-checks coverage\nNavigator: renews sign-ins, write-back, disconnects"
screen elig "Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits\nReader, Verify: ask each source\nCaller: phones if a system does not answer\nCriteria: is authorization required\nNavigator: is the clinic enrolled to bill"
screen ref "Authorizations › New case › Referral and Medical records\nReader: reads each file and the referral\nVerify: Coverage tab\nPlacement: Fit tab\nCriteria: Decline reasons"
screen run "Authorizations › New case › Agents work\nTen in order: Reader, Verify, Criteria, Historian, Placement, Forecaster, Scribe, Integrity, Packet, Scrubber\nScribe and Packet may ask one question"
screen sign "Authorizations › New case › Review and sign\nIntegrity: every sentence traces to the chart\nA licensed clinician signs"
screen auth "Authorizations › Queue and Case page\nCriteria: what the payer asks for\nScribe, Integrity, Forecaster: update the draft and re-score the chance\nEach row shows the agent holding the request"
screen mgr "Case Manager\nEach case shows the agent working on it\nReviews this week: drafted by Scribe or Cadence"
screen dash "Dashboard\nNavigator: sends signed requests, checks status\nCaller: phones if still pending\nPacket: drafts the answer to an information request\nIntegrity: checks it\nCadence: ledger, next review, write-back"
screen den "Denial Intelligence\nReader: reads the letter\nAdvocate: checks the notice, drafts the appeal\nHistorian: compares similar decisions\nIntegrity: checks every statement\nCadence: books the peer-to-peer\nNavigator: files the appeal after a signature"
screen pay "Payers\nHistorian: proposals on Changes\nScribe, Integrity: redraft open drafts\nProcess tab names Navigator, Caller, Packet and others on each step\nSentinel: only the 'Payer rule changed' notification"
screen note "Top bar › Notifications\nEvery item carries the agent that raised it\nAdvocate, Cadence, Caller, Navigator, Packet, Reader, Scribe, Forecaster, Sentinel"
screen ana "Analytics\nAnalyst: builds the monthly report"
goto g1 "Continues in: Settings › Agent map › Where each of the sixteen agents works"

emr -->|Pull a chart| ref
elig -->|Coverage checked| ref
ref --> run --> sign
sign -->|Sign and send| dash
run -.-> mgr
auth -.-> mgr
mgr --> sign
dash -->|Denied or partly approved| den
pay -.->|Rule change updates drafts| run
dash --> ana
den --> ana
dash -.-> note
den -.-> note
pay -.-> note
ana --> g1
